/F2 12 Tf
0 -16 Td
(3. Experiment 2: Measurement of Friction Coefficients on an Inclined Plane) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Apparatus: Adjustable wooden inclined track, protractor, friction block, spring balance.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Theory: Static friction coefficient mu_s = tan\(theta_c\), where theta_c is the angle of impending motion.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Calculations: Record 5 trials of critical slipping angle. Compute mean angle and standard error.) Tj
